1. Policy Violation
 Execution attempted outside permitted boundaries.

2. Unauthorized Access Attempt
 External connection or API call not on whitelist.

3. State Anomaly
 Internal behavior diverged from verified baseline.

4. Integrity Breach
 Hash inconsistency detected — possible tampering.

Each event includes: timestamp, event type,
action taken, and affected layer.

Severity classification and logging consistency
would be defined at the enterprise level —
depending on what needs to be governed and how.


